<title>USA: Oil City, Pa., repriced, top yield still 5.40 pct.</title>
<headline>Oil City, Pa., repriced, top yield still 5.40 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said Wednesday it repriced Oil City, Pa.'s $3.3 million bond issue, adjusting yields in the 2002 through 2004 maturities but leaving the top yield in 2010 unchanged at 5.40 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>RE: $3,330,000*</p>
<p>CITY OF OIL CITY</p>
<p>VENANGO COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>REGISTERED</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING IN THE 2002 THROUGH 2004 MATURITIES.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: NAF</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1997		  310M    3.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/1998		  265M    4.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/1999		  275M    4.20  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2000		  280M    4.30  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2001		  310M    4.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2002		  310M    4.50  %	  4.55</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.74 )</p>
<p>10/01/2003		  255M    4.65  %	  4.70</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.704)</p>
<p>10/01/2004		  265M    4.80  %	  4.85</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.67 )</p>
<p>10/01/2005		  290M    4.90  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2006		  295M    5.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2007		  310M    5.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 99.579)</p>
<p>10/01/2010		  220M    5.40  %	100.00</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/01/2001    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, October 23, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 21, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is pending through DTC.</p>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
